<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-081" chapter-id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family" source-id="s-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family">
  <p id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0000" ref="cws_842_o4u">鄧岳</persName>，字<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0004" ref="cws_842_o4u">伯山</persName>，陳郡人也。本名<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0014" ref="cws_842_o4u">岳</persName>，以犯康帝諱，改為<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0024" ref="cws_842_o4u">嶽</persName>，後竟改名為<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0031" ref="cws_842_o4u">岱</persName>焉。少有將帥才略，為<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0042" ref="39o_b6y_n74">王敦</persName>參軍。轉從事中郎、西陽太守。<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0058" ref="mwc_md4_l0g">王含</persName>構產逆，<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0064" ref="cws_842_o4u">嶽</persName>領兵隨<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0068" ref="mwc_md4_l0g">含</persName>向京都。及<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0074" ref="mwc_md4_l0g">含</persName>敗，<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0077" ref="cws_842_o4u">岳</persName>與<persName id="c-jinshu-081-jin098-wang-family:career:m0079" ref="smf_swf_i2l">周撫</persName>俱奔蠻王向蠶。</p>
</text>
